# README media: TURNIP TRUCK. The GIF and the driving shots are the demo
# player pressing real buttons; the chaos is set up with cheats (which day,
# where the truck is, a saucer or the beet close by), then driven.
shotscale 2
seed 23
game turnip
wait 60
shot turnip_title
press A
wait 150
shot turnip_news
press A
wait 2
# Monday: the first deliveries round the depot
botplay 120
gifstart turnip 4 2
botplay 400
gifstop
# the big beet, charging down the street
seed 5
cheat day 3 2
cheat notraffic
cheat traffic
cheat clearmobs
cheat pos 400 276
cheat ang 0
cheat stop
cheat mob 0 520 264
botplay 14
shot turnip_beet
# the downpour, puddles on every road
seed 6
cheat day 5 5
botplay 900
shot turnip_rain
# the moon raid over Old Blipton
seed 7
cheat day 6 6
cheat clearmobs
cheat pos 400 276
cheat ang 0
cheat stop
cheat mob 4 470 230
cheat mob 3 330 300
cheat mob 2 440 330
cheat mob 2 360 220
botplay 50
shot turnip_moon
# brine bursting from the pipes at the Pickle Works
seed 8
cheat day 4 1
cheat notraffic
cheat pos 520 1212
cheat ang 0
cheat stop
wait 130
shot turnip_brine
